01:52:21.540 --> 01:52:24.900
for most, or at times that
people want to know a lot about.

01:52:24.900 --> 01:52:26.490
What should they eat before training

01:52:26.490 --> 01:52:27.840
or can they train fasted?

01:52:27.840 --> 01:52:29.070
What should they eat afterwards?

01:52:29.070 --> 01:52:32.228
But just in general, what
