01:52:32.228 --> 01:52:35.010
of nutrition that really hold.

01:52:35.010 --> 01:52:36.617
And I ask this 'cause,

01:52:37.740 --> 01:52:40.470
not because there's a
lot of debate about this,

01:52:40.470 --> 01:52:43.076
but because you've been
around this space a long time

01:52:43.076 --> 01:52:46.500
and you've seen what
works for you obviously

01:52:46.500 --> 01:52:48.930
but for other people too.

01:52:48.930 --> 01:52:50.070
What tends to work?

01:52:50.070 --> 01:52:51.900
What tends not to work?

01:52:51.900 --> 01:52:54.420
And how should we think about nutrition?

