01:55:02.910 --> 01:55:04.290
It was normal sunlight.

01:55:04.290 --> 01:55:07.350
It was blinding to me,
the photosensitivity I had

01:55:07.350 --> 01:55:09.480
learning later on after a few more courses

01:55:09.480 --> 01:55:11.061
that I took there in biology

01:55:11.061 --> 01:55:16.061
how necessary fat was for the
development of healthy cells.

01:55:18.900 --> 01:55:21.141
I realized what was going on

01:55:21.141 --> 01:55:23.640
and not to mention other
stuff skin was bad,

01:55:23.640 --> 01:55:25.230
hair was falling out, all kinds of stuff.

01:55:25.230 --> 01:55:30.230
So I think that the
approach to decreasing fat

01:55:31.950 --> 01:55:33.240
so it's not excessive,

01:55:33.240 --> 01:55:34.890
because again how
calorically dense it could be

01:55:34.890 --> 01:55:36.360
