01:55:36.360 --> 01:55:39.360
I'm a firm believer in
sugar is really pretty toxic

01:55:39.360 --> 01:55:43.020
and something that we would
all do better getting rid of

01:55:43.020 --> 01:55:44.244
a lot of it.

01:55:44.244 --> 01:55:48.450
That is the best approach
for, I believe, again,

01:55:48.450 --> 01:55:52.290
in my opinion, personally,
for the overall big picture.

01:55:52.290 --> 01:55:55.860
Because though the people can
take exclusionary approaches

01:55:55.860 --> 01:55:58.360
to nutrition and taking carbs out or

01:55:58.360 --> 01:56:02.370
eating only fats and proteins, or again,

01:56:02.370 --> 01:56:03.780
I'm not saying it doesn't work for you.

01:56:03.780 --> 01:56:05.760
And if it's the first thing
that actually allowed you

01:56:05.760 --> 01:56:06.990
to gain control of your nutrition

01:56:06.990 --> 01:56:08.280
to the point where you
actually saw results

01:56:08.280 --> 01:56:10.620
and got to a healthier
