01:56:11.820 --> 01:56:14.070
But just make sure it's
something you can do forever

01:56:14.070 --> 01:56:17.040
and doesn't bring upon
other repercussions.

01:56:17.040 --> 01:56:21.603
But I think that non
exclusionary approaches to diets

01:56:21.603 --> 01:56:25.800
are the most sustainable
for the rest of your life.

01:56:25.800 --> 01:56:28.190
And all I'm interested in
